+for the upper right entry of a general $k$. As $KgK=\coprod_{u\in K/(K\cap gKg^{-1})}ugK$ (the stabiliser of the coset $gK$ under left multiplication by $K$ is
+$K\cap gKg^{-1}$), we get $KgK=\coprod_ju_jgK=\coprod_j\varpi_jK$ because $u_jg=\left(\begin{smallmatrix}p&j\\0&1\end{smallmatrix}\right)=\varpi_j$.
+This proves Def.~\ref{def:s01-NUp}, and (a): the matrices $\varpi_j$ involve neither $s$ nor the choice of $U_0$ versus $U_1$.
+
