+\emph{Index $p^2$ (F4).} For $s\ge1$, $[K_s:K_{s+1}]=p^2$. Indeed $K_{s}$ is the stabiliser in $\GL_2(\Zp)$ of the row vector $(0,1)\bmod p^s$ for the right action
