+the vectors $(c,d)\bmod p^{s+1}$ with $c\equiv0$, $d\equiv1\bmod p^s$ ($p\cdot p$ of them), and all occur, already for $k=\left(\begin{smallmatrix}1&0\\c&d\end{smallmatrix}\right)\in K_s$. So $[K_s:K_{s+1}]=p^2$ (while $[K^0_s:K^0_{s+1}]=p$ and the number of
