+The lattice $L=p^{s+2}\Zp\oplus p^{s+1}\Zp$ is preserved by the right action of $K_{s+1}$ (for $(x,y)\in L$: $xa+yc\in p^{s+2}$ because $2s+2\ge s+2$, and $xb+yd\in p^{s+1}$), and $H$ is the stabiliser of $(0,1)\bmod L$ in $K_{s+1}$;
